acceptance_criteria: "npm run coverage reports 100 lines, 100 branches and 100 functions with all 8 files present in the measured set; coverageGate.thresholds is 100/100/100; no coverage ignore comments and no additions to coverageGate.ignore; npm run docstring still reports the documented surface complete."
resolution: "Covered cli.ts and extension.ts fully, closed the final generator branch, and raised the fail-closed gate to exact 100/100/100."
expected_result: "Every measured source and the aggregate report exact 100 percent lines, branches, and functions."
actual_result: 406 tests pass; all nine measured sources and aggregate report 100.00/100.00/100.00; release check passes.
