  "2026-08-07T20:46:01.362Z","harness:codex",Baseline on main a0dfa9e reproduces 379 passing tests at 93.74/92.40/93.80. The required npm ci also exposed a distinct package-local pm 2026.8.6 prepare regression that removes the 2026.8.7 extension merge fence; a separate P0 issue now owns that compatibility fix so the coverage task remains honest and non-duplicative.
  "2026-08-07T21:12:49.033Z","harness:codex","Exact coverage achieved on 2026-08-07: npm run coverage reports 406 passing tests and 100.00 lines, 100.00 branches, and 100.00 functions for every one of the nine measured sources. package.json now enforces 100/100/100 with no new ignore entries or coverage pragmas. npm run release:check passes."
